Comment: 99,1:18:29.68,1:18:29.73,GJM_Main_1080p,chapter,0,0,0,,{Credits}
Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.59,0:00:31.59,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.59,0:00:35.14,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}have you heard the rumor about the tunnel\N that can get you whatever you want?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:35.14,0:00:36.43,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,The what now?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:36.43,0:00:39.46,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}There's apparently a torii gate deep inside\N the tunnel, and if you pass through it
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.46,0:00:40.98,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,you get what you want.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:41.54,0:00:45.12,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,But in exchange, you age a hundred years.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.12,0:00:48.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Crazy! What's the tunnel called?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:49.33,0:00:50.91,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's called...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:53.21,0:00:54.41,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,The Urashima Tunnel.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:56.91,0:00:59.32,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'd just ask for money, I think.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:59.32,0:01:02.13,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It'd let me buy whatever I want, after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.13,0:01:04.36,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Except you can't buy anything in this tiny village.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:04.36,0:01:05.50,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,True, actually.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.27,0:01:09.51,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm {\i1}so{\i0} moving to Tokyo after I finish school.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.52,0:03:32.88,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an8}A deer has been struck by a train\N between Oosara and Sugimori stations.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.88,0:03:38.49,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an8}Regrettably, the next train is expected\N to be delayed by around thirty minutes.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.99,0:03:41.62,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We apologize for the inconvenience
Dialogue: 99,0:03:41.62,0:03:43.62,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and appreciate your patience.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.67,0:03:55.46,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:58.67,0:03:59.55,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:59.83,0:04:02.31,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Staring at people like that is creepy.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.12,0:04:06.08,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you before, is all.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.36,0:04:10.83,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It's quite common around here\N for trains to be delayed because of deer.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:43.93,0:04:44.86,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I have an umbrella.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.79,0:04:46.59,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Wanna borrow it?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.65,0:04:49.95,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What's your deal?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:49.95,0:04:51.85,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I noticed you don't have one.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:51.85,0:04:54.57,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And it looked like you didn't\N want your bag to get wet.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:54.57,0:04:57.21,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,The hell? Are you playing a good Samaritan?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.21,0:04:59.15,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You lend me the umbrella and then what?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.64,0:05:01.10,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You have another one for yourself?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:01.10,0:05:02.38,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.38,0:05:04.20,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,But I live close to the station.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:04.20,0:05:05.66,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That doesn't answer my question.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:05.97,0:05:07.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You're gonna catch a cold at this rate.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:07.99,0:05:10.11,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Your parents probably won't want\N to see you drenched like this.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.40,0:05:14.50,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Same goes for you, no?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:14.50,0:05:15.47,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:16.61,0:05:18.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No one cares about me, so it's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:21.20,0:05:23.97,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And I don't have parents.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:25.28,0:05:26.56,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That must be nice.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.30,0:05:36.89,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Can I borrow the umbrella, after all?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:37.54,0:05:38.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:43.55,0:05:45.18,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Give me your name and phone number.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:45.18,0:05:45.62,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:45.86,0:05:47.63,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I always return what I borrow.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.18,0:05:50.45,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'll contact you about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:00.78,0:06:03.03,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Touno Kaoru.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.03,0:06:05.34,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Hanashiro Anzu...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:18.50,0:07:21.57,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,All right, quiet down, everyone!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:21.57,0:07:23.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Let's start homeroom!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:24.30,0:07:28.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,First, let me introduce the new transfer student.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:27.99,0:07:28.99,GJM_Overlap_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, it was today?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.99,0:07:30.19,GJM_Overlap_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The new student coming?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.17,0:07:36.35,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}This is Hanashiro Anzu,\N who transferred here from Tokyo.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:36.98,0:07:39.21,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,A few words of introduction, if you please.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:39.21,0:07:40.34,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to say.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:40.34,0:07:40.64,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:40.64,0:07:42.20,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Can I go sit down?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.20,0:07:43.94,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:48.01,0:07:49.62,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,So we're in the same class.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.28,0:07:52.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That saves me some trouble.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.40,0:07:53.87,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'll bring the umbrella tomorrow.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:56.39,0:07:57.96,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What's this about an umbrella?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:57.96,0:07:59.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,They know each other?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:58.94,0:07:59.90,GJM_Overlap_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh, some drama?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:59.90,0:08:01.92,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Let's talk to her during the break.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:01.92,0:08:04.92,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,All right, all right, let's move on.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.70,0:08:08.37,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Say, where you do live, Hanashiro?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:08.37,0:08:09.58,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Do you have any hobbies?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:09.58,0:08:11.88,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Why do those things matter to you?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:13.92,0:08:16.10,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What are you reading, Hanashiro?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.10,0:08:17.75,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Wanna go to a cafe after school?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.75,0:08:19.32,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Would you stop bothering me, please?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:20.31,0:08:22.35,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What's your plan for lunch, Hanashiro?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:22.35,0:08:23.82,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Let's eat together.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:23.82,0:08:25.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I already ate.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:27.65,0:08:28.89,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Crazy.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:28.89,0:08:29.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Impregnable.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.90,0:08:31.14,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It only attracts more attention.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:31.14,0:08:32.91,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I bet Kawasaki will be coming for her.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.26,0:08:36.65,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but just who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:36.65,0:08:37.62,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Called it.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:37.62,0:08:40.74,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Acting like you're the most important person\N in the world on your first day already.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:40.74,0:08:43.43,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Are you perhaps a princess or something?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:46.92,0:08:48.26,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:51.30,0:08:53.32,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a manga.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:53.32,0:08:54.89,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,A really old one at that.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:54.89,0:08:56.23,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Mind giving it back?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.23,0:08:59.48,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You gave off such a serious aura I thought\N you'd be reading some incomprehensible stuff.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:59.48,0:09:00.47,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Give it back.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:00.47,0:09:01.61,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.50,0:09:07.56,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Aw, my bad. My hand slipped.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:07.56,0:09:10.08,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's such an old manga, maybe it was moldy.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.08,0:09:12.42,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You know, making it all slippery.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:12.42,0:09:13.85,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Can't believe I touched it.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:13.85,0:09:14.41,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Say...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:15.69,0:09:18.54,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Are you picking a fight?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:18.86,0:09:19.62,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What if I was?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:27.28,0:09:28.46,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, you're bleeding!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:28.46,0:09:31.18,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,This is bad, go get a teacher!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:32.21,0:09:33.51,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'll go with you!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.62,0:10:05.25,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What the fuck?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:06.08,0:10:07.50,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:07.50,0:10:09.51,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Always running her mouth!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:10.12,0:10:12.43,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What does she think I am?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:14.24,0:10:15.18,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh, you were home?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:15.92,0:10:17.08,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there watching.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:18.08,0:10:19.97,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'll bring you some water.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.64,0:10:24.42,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,There was this old hag in the town hall today.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:25.21,0:10:27.97,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,She reminded me about Karen's death anniversary.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.97,0:10:29.97,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Asked me if I'm going to visit her grave again.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:29.97,0:10:30.88,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I swear...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:31.62,0:10:34.58,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Was that her idea of being nice?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.31,0:10:36.83,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Surely you agree it's cruel.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:38.40,0:10:39.21,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.21,0:10:41.16,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,The fuck did you say?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:41.68,0:10:43.93,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No patience left for your father?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:44.72,0:10:46.63,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's all your fault, you know!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:47.07,0:10:49.59,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You killed Karen!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:49.59,0:10:52.17,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,All you ever do is listen to this damn music!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:54.01,0:10:56.15,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Give me back my Karen!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:56.87,0:10:59.14,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you have to die to make it happen!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:00.02,0:11:03.18,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Just return Karen to me, come on!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:04.00,0:11:05.21,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:05.21,0:11:06.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Kaoru!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:26.19,0:12:27.79,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:12.27,0:13:14.74,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:01.89,0:14:03.12,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:56.32,0:14:57.27,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Karen...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:59.69,0:15:02.01,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Why is this here?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:03.12,0:15:04.80,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Karen is...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:11.18,0:15:13.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Karen! Karen!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:17.40,0:15:18.59,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.21,0:15:22.05,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,A bird?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:23.52,0:15:24.63,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,A parrot, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:29.20,0:15:33.53,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Can you hear this gentle song?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:33.53,0:15:36.96,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's a croaking little frog.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.03,0:15:41.66,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No way. Scree?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:41.66,0:15:43.04,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,But you were dead.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:52.33,0:15:54.02,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Urashima Tunnel...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:19.08,0:16:20.30,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Is this real?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:23.06,0:16:24.06,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:31.58,0:16:32.47,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What it sang
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.25,0:16:35.47,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,was the nursery rhyme Karen and I taught Scree together.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:36.85,0:16:38.28,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Is this really Scree?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:46.90,0:16:49.16,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What was that? Who's there?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:57.84,0:16:59.18,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Kaoru.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.18,0:17:00.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:01.49,0:17:03.04,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:03.04,0:17:05.62,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I didn't know what I'd do if I lost you as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.25,0:17:07.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.33,0:17:13.72,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I was just drunk that night.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:14.25,0:17:16.59,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,So don't go running away from home again.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:16.59,0:17:19.95,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I didn't know what to do,\N and even the school contacted me.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:20.79,0:17:22.93,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Whose place were you staying at?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:22.93,0:17:26.28,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You didn't just sleep\N somewhere on the streets, did you?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.28,0:17:28.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:28.90,0:17:30.61,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I just went out for a walk.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.61,0:17:35.54,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Okay, if you don't wanna tell me, then fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:36.09,0:17:39.63,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But there'll be consequences if you disappear\N for a week without letting me know again.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:45.76,0:17:46.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,A week?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:55.10,0:17:55.93,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.75,0:18:08.10,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,22nd?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:03.66,0:19:05.87,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Where you been this past week?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:05.87,0:19:08.69,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I managed to catch the flu.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:08.69,0:19:11.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And how come you didn't respond to any messages?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:11.22,0:19:13.24,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I forgot to charge my phone.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:13.24,0:19:14.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:14.22,0:19:15.70,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're back.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:15.70,0:19:17.09,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm finally feeling better, yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.09,0:19:18.45,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Glad you're not dead.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:18.45,0:19:19.14,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.14,0:19:20.28,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Coming tomorrow too?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:20.28,0:19:21.63,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:21.63,0:19:23.21,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'll bring your umbrella, then.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:23.21,0:19:24.63,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I don't want it lying around.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:25.27,0:19:26.57,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,She's totally worried.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:26.57,0:19:27.49,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,About?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:27.49,0:19:29.15,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You, you idiot!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:38.30,0:20:39.42,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a dream.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.45,0:20:43.94,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Urashima Tunnel is real.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:45.66,0:20:49.43,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And if I get Karen back...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.98,0:20:55.98,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Karen...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:57.05,0:20:57.97,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Karen!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:57.97,0:20:58.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:00.52,0:21:01.82,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Hanashiro?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:01.82,0:21:03.71,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What is this place, Touno?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:02.49,0:21:03.71,GJM_Overlap_1080p,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, now!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:04.44,0:21:05.37,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:17.30,0:21:20.35,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. Why is it dark now?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:23.29,0:21:25.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I hope you have a good explanation.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.61,0:21:31.69,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.46,0:21:36.00,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}So while you're in the tunnel,\N time passes differently than on the outside.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:37.64,0:21:39.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Just a couple seconds in there
Dialogue: 99,0:21:39.39,0:21:41.42,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,resulted in five hours passing here.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:42.45,0:21:46.27,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I can see how time would pass you by in there.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:46.89,0:21:50.72,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,But in exchange you can get whatever you want...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:53.94,0:21:56.88,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,So? Did you get what you wanted?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:57.76,0:21:58.34,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:59.66,0:22:01.47,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,But I'm convinced I can.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:04.00,0:22:05.61,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Have you told anyone else
Dialogue: 99,0:22:05.61,0:22:07.20,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,about this tunnel?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:07.20,0:22:08.23,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,As if I could.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:08.93,0:22:11.13,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No one would believe me if I simply told them.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:11.67,0:22:13.44,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Seeing is believing after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:16.36,0:22:17.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Touno.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:18.06,0:22:18.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:19.41,0:22:22.11,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Will you work with me?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:22.11,0:22:23.24,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:23.58,0:22:25.52,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,There's something I want, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:25.52,0:22:27.42,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You're already trying to get what you want.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:28.22,0:22:29.49,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,We technically have the same goal,
Dialogue: 99,0:22:29.90,0:22:33.76,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}so we might as well work together\N towards figuring out this tunnel, no?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:34.85,0:22:36.63,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'll get what I want,
Dialogue: 99,0:22:36.94,0:22:39.83,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,and you'll get what you want this way.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:41.03,0:22:41.76,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:42.30,0:22:44.23,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's a bad deal.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:52.88,0:22:54.80,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I was fortunate to have met you,
Dialogue: 99,0:22:54.80,0:22:56.10,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Touno Kaoru.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:26.01,0:23:29.70,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,So today's the day our alliance begins,
Dialogue: 99,0:23:29.70,0:23:31.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,but are you actually ready?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:31.40,0:23:32.69,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:32.69,0:23:35.50,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I was originally prepared to go it alone.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:35.50,0:23:36.76,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,So I should really be asking if you—
Dialogue: 99,0:23:36.76,0:23:37.65,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:38.44,0:23:41.61,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Meet me at the railway crossing after school, then.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:42.20,0:23:45.74,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And absolutely no telling anyone about the tunnel.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:46.28,0:23:48.35,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,This is our secret.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:50.95,0:23:53.19,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,So what's the plan?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:53.19,0:23:55.91,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Let's first figure out the difference
Dialogue: 99,0:23:55.91,0:23:58.54,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}in the passage of time between\N the tunnel and the outside.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:58.54,0:24:00.12,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Ideally we want the exact difference.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:00.12,0:24:01.13,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And how do we do that?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:01.47,0:24:02.34,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:02.67,0:24:03.36,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:03.36,0:24:04.37,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Okay, go on, then.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:07.32,0:24:08.59,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No silence allowed.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:09.01,0:24:10.98,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Keep talking to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:10.98,0:24:12.63,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,If there's any delay or we cut off
Dialogue: 99,0:24:12.63,0:24:14.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}that'll mean you entered\N the area where time passes differently.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:14.99,0:24:16.44,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to talk about, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:16.44,0:24:18.45,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about making actual conversation.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:18.45,0:24:19.56,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Just say whatever.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:20.36,0:24:23.51,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Have you punched people\N in your previous school too?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:23.51,0:24:24.58,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:24.58,0:24:26.16,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You told me anything's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:26.77,0:24:27.71,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:27.71,0:24:29.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I do feel sorry for Kawasaki, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:29.39,0:24:31.91,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,She's the first person I've ever punched.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:31.91,0:24:34.29,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,If you feel sorry, you could just apologize, you know.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:34.29,0:24:37.12,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}She was the one who picked a fight,\N so shouldn't she apologize first?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:37.59,0:24:40.03,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,If I do apologize, it'll be after she does.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:40.03,0:24:40.86,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:40.86,0:24:44.73,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I mean, she spoke ill of something\N I value, so I think getting mad is—
Dialogue: 99,0:24:44.73,0:24:45.55,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It cut off!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:51.00,0:24:53.24,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's been 65 minutes since our call died.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:53.24,0:24:56.18,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I immediately turned around\N and still over an hour passed?!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:56.18,0:24:59.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,So? Where did you stop hearing me?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:59.22,0:25:01.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,The moment I passed under the red maple trees.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:02.92,0:25:05.14,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Figured. That's what I expected.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:07.16,0:25:09.86,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go figure out some more.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:10.89,0:25:14.60,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It'll help us get what we want from the tunnel.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:34.83,0:25:37.93,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Make sure you stay in between\N the trees for only three seconds.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:37.93,0:25:38.77,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:40.13,0:25:41.93,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Three seconds is two hours.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:41.93,0:25:45.66,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,So thirty seconds is twenty hours?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:45.66,0:25:46.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,One hour is a hundred days.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:48.09,0:25:51.03,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,One day is... six and a half years.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:54.70,0:25:57.86,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I wanna know if we can contact each other\N between the inside and the outside.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:57.86,0:25:59.04,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,A call disconnected,
Dialogue: 99,0:25:59.36,0:26:00.41,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,but what about messages?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:09.16,0:26:10.15,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Did you get it?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:11.47,0:26:12.81,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I got it now.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:12.81,0:26:14.89,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Looks like the time difference affects messages too.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:22.38,0:26:25.67,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's a tunnel, so there has to be another exit, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:31.64,0:26:32.95,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:48.36,0:26:49.47,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Mind getting off me?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:50.45,0:26:52.09,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:04.20,0:27:07.00,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You've been spending lots of time with Hanashiro lately.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:07.00,0:27:08.69,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,We're just hanging out.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:08.69,0:27:09.78,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Are you a couple now?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:09.78,0:27:11.03,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:11.50,0:27:13.54,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Is this really your dead parrot?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:13.54,0:27:15.58,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It can sing a nursery rhyme I taught it in the past.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:15.58,0:27:16.83,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I think that proves it.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:17.48,0:27:20.20,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,So this is why you said you're convinced.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:21.97,0:27:24.11,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Is it true that Hanashiro went to your place?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:24.11,0:27:25.11,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:25.11,0:27:26.29,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It does matter!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:26.29,0:27:27.82,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It matters a helluva lot!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:27.82,0:27:29.15,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You absolutely must be dating!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:29.15,0:27:30.84,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And I'm telling you we're not!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:31.52,0:27:36.10,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Maybe the tunnel is related to\N some regional beliefs or local spirits.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:36.10,0:27:37.43,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's worth looking into.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:25.21,0:28:30.95,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We haven't tested yet if we can send messages\N from this side to someone inside the tunnel.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:30.95,0:28:33.48,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Well, if it works one way,\N it should work the other way too.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:33.48,0:28:35.64,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'll send you a message as soon as you pass through.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:35.64,0:28:37.92,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Check your inbox and come back.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:37.92,0:28:38.87,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:55.80,0:28:58.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Hanashiro...
Dialogue: 99,0:29:03.30,0:29:04.05,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Anzu!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:06.07,0:29:06.77,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:12.08,0:29:13.23,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's been seven hours.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:14.08,0:29:15.19,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Took you a while.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:16.01,0:29:18.52,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Though I guess for you it's been ten seconds.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:19.01,0:29:19.70,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:19.96,0:29:21.82,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:21.82,0:29:22.62,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No need to apologize.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:24.74,0:29:25.71,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What about the message?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:32.51,0:29:34.48,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Can't receive them from the outside.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:35.34,0:29:37.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling that'd be the case.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:39.53,0:29:40.21,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:40.21,0:29:44.50,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Also, I don't remember telling you\N that you can use my first name.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:44.50,0:29:46.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Ah, I wasn't really thinking...
Dialogue: 99,0:29:48.54,0:29:50.12,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I don't mind, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:51.95,0:29:52.77,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:54.22,0:29:56.63,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Let's head back. It's gotten late.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:24.52,0:30:26.80,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,A 108 second round trip
Dialogue: 99,0:30:26.80,0:30:28.66,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,will use up our long weekend...
Dialogue: 99,0:30:51.75,0:30:53.67,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's go already!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:54.80,0:30:56.42,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:56.42,0:30:58.83,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Did you wait long, Touno?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:00.96,0:31:03.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No, I mean, you're right on time, Anzu.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:03.40,0:31:05.76,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Isn't that normal?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:07.16,0:31:07.85,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:14.63,0:31:16.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Why'd you invite me to the aquarium?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:17.18,0:31:20.76,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I couldn't find any other places\N worth seeing anywhere nearby.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:20.76,0:31:21.98,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:21.98,0:31:25.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Plus, I'm quite fond of you, Touno.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:25.40,0:31:26.32,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:26.32,0:31:27.74,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I mean, don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:28.00,0:31:29.98,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm not in love with you or anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:30.69,0:31:31.49,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I figured.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:32.29,0:31:36.15,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You've never smiled in front of me, ever.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:36.15,0:31:37.24,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:37.24,0:31:38.13,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:39.14,0:31:41.11,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And you have this... fearless?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:41.63,0:31:44.05,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Full of confidence? Kind of smile.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:44.05,0:31:45.31,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Do I?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:45.31,0:31:46.23,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you do.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:50.89,0:31:51.87,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,The other day...
Dialogue: 99,0:31:52.46,0:31:54.31,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,When you crossed the tree line...
Dialogue: 99,0:32:00.63,0:32:01.73,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I was scared.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:03.55,0:32:07.95,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Scared of the tunnel\N severing its link with this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:08.36,0:32:12.70,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I felt like nothing I could do,\N nothing I could say would ever reach you.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:13.29,0:32:16.72,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That's why I want us to communicate.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:16.72,0:32:18.67,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,We're in this together.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:19.94,0:32:22.53,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do this if you're afraid.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:24.78,0:32:26.31,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I can't give up now.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:26.31,0:32:28.78,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I have to get what I want.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:29.55,0:32:33.07,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}There's no way to know, but next time\N we enter the tunnel, I might actually get it.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:33.68,0:32:36.03,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Aren't you hoping for that as well?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:43.21,0:32:46.85,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I've been to this aquarium before.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:47.82,0:32:49.30,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,With my dad, my mom,
Dialogue: 99,0:32:50.10,0:32:51.73,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,and my sister Karen.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:51.73,0:32:53.24,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh, you have a sister?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:54.08,0:32:58.25,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,She was always so thoughtful of my parents and me.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:58.25,0:32:59.37,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Was?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:00.49,0:33:01.66,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,She died.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:01.66,0:33:02.83,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Fell from a tree.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:05.05,0:33:08.59,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,She always wanted everyone to be happy.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:10.16,0:33:12.09,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Is there anything you want, Kaoru?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:12.36,0:33:13.25,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,A beetle.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:13.25,0:33:14.68,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,We can get some over there.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:15.24,0:33:18.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You know what I want?\N A world where everyone's smiling.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:19.02,0:33:22.39,GJM_Overlap_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wouldn't a world like that be super creepy?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:19.57,0:33:22.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,She always wished for everyone to be happy.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:22.39,0:33:24.96,GJM_Overlap_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What do you mean? It'd be awesome!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:23.58,0:33:27.44,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But that day, I had a fight\N with her over something silly...
Dialogue: 99,0:33:27.75,0:33:29.36,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I hate you, Kaoru!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:29.36,0:33:31.17,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I hate you too.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:31.17,0:33:32.36,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:32.36,0:33:34.14,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I love you!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:34.14,0:33:35.45,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:37.61,0:33:40.42,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}When I got back home,\N I learned she'd fallen from a tree and died.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:41.48,0:33:44.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}She was trying to catch a beetle\N for me, and that's how she fell.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:45.78,0:33:48.09,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Then my mom left,
Dialogue: 99,0:33:48.09,0:33:51.26,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,and my dad started drinking and shouting at me.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:51.26,0:33:52.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It ruined our entire family.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:55.09,0:33:57.23,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,So what you want is...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:00.09,0:34:01.55,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'll enter the tunnel
Dialogue: 99,0:34:04.09,0:34:06.44,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,and bring Karen back.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:10.85,0:34:15.67,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Do I... look scary when I'm in the tunnel?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:25.36,0:34:26.67,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:43.44,0:34:45.02,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What did you tell your parents?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:45.31,0:34:47.09,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Did I not tell you?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:47.09,0:34:49.03,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I don't have parents.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:49.03,0:34:50.53,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you did.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:50.53,0:34:51.69,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:51.69,0:34:52.53,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:52.53,0:34:54.36,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,We run there and back within 108 seconds.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:54.36,0:34:58.06,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}That way, we'll be back on\N the last day of our long weekend.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:58.06,0:34:59.45,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Make sure you don't trip.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:00.25,0:35:02.71,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I may not look like it, but I'm quite sporty.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:03.44,0:35:04.83,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,We go on "go".
Dialogue: 99,0:35:06.97,0:35:08.00,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 99,0:35:08.88,0:35:09.25,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:31.44,0:35:32.23,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's time, Anzu!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:32.55,0:35:33.74,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Turn around!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:36.28,0:35:36.91,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Anzu!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:37.81,0:35:38.76,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:38.76,0:35:39.73,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,We need to get back!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:39.73,0:35:41.00,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Go without me!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:41.00,0:35:42.66,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up to you once I pick these up.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:42.66,0:35:43.84,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I can't leave you behind!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:43.84,0:35:44.88,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Just leave these and—
Dialogue: 99,0:35:44.12,0:35:45.62,GJM_Overlap_1080p,,0,0,0,,I can't leave these!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:55.20,0:35:56.38,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That's all of them!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:25.65,0:36:28.08,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Is that what you wanted?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:30.62,0:36:36.05,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It's the only thing I have\N that connects me to my grandpa.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:47.34,0:36:49.31,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's already four in the morning...
Dialogue: 99,0:36:49.31,0:36:52.32,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I have no idea what my dad will say\N if I go back home now.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:52.88,0:36:54.58,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I need to do something about my clothes, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:55.59,0:36:56.56,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 99,0:36:58.73,0:37:00.75,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Wanna come to my place?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:07.09,0:37:08.10,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Wear this.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:08.70,0:37:10.14,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Is this your dad's?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:10.14,0:37:12.98,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,My uncle used to live in this apartment.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:12.98,0:37:15.72,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,He moved back home, so I'm using it now.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:16.25,0:37:17.08,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And you're on your own?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:17.08,0:37:18.92,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I told you I don't have parents, no?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:30.94,0:37:32.07,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:34.93,0:37:36.64,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Hanashiro Mitsuo?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:41.89,0:37:42.78,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:43.12,0:37:44.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I probably should've asked first.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:45.90,0:37:47.05,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's fine, keep reading.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:47.05,0:37:49.00,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,This Hanashiro Mitsuo...
Dialogue: 99,0:37:49.00,0:37:50.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,My grandfather.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:50.39,0:37:53.57,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Isn't this the same manga\N Kawasaki dropped onto the floor?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:53.57,0:37:57.01,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's actually very important to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:57.92,0:38:01.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Anzu, are those pages\N that appeared in the tunnel
Dialogue: 99,0:38:01.22,0:38:02.68,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,your grandfather's manga?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:04.66,0:38:06.24,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And if they aren't,
Dialogue: 99,0:38:06.24,0:38:08.56,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,are they something you drew yourself?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:08.56,0:38:09.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:09.39,0:38:10.08,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:10.08,0:38:12.11,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,How? What made you think that?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:12.11,0:38:13.27,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That envelope.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:13.62,0:38:16.34,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,When I first met you,
Dialogue: 99,0:38:16.34,0:38:18.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,you were hugging it as if it meant the world to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:18.90,0:38:21.49,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It says Yuutousha, and that's a famous publisher.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:21.49,0:38:23.21,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Your grandfather was a manga artist.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:23.21,0:38:25.65,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Plus, there's tons of art supplies on your desk,
Dialogue: 99,0:38:25.65,0:38:26.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,so I figured you must be drawing.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:33.62,0:38:37.11,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You're right. I'm drawing manga.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:37.11,0:38:39.87,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The day we met,\N I wanted to send it to a publisher.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:39.87,0:38:41.43,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you send it, then?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:42.74,0:38:45.05,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,How many manga artists do you think exist?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:45.05,0:38:47.25,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,About a thousand?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:47.25,0:38:48.68,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,More like five thousand.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:48.68,0:38:50.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And on top of that,
Dialogue: 99,0:38:50.22,0:38:54.94,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}every year, thousands more submit their work\Nin an attempt to become manga artists too.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:55.27,0:38:57.82,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm competing against.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:58.52,0:38:59.94,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Kinda scary, no?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:00.89,0:39:02.44,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That's why I couldn't send it.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:02.44,0:39:04.52,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,But you won't know for sure unless you try—
Dialogue: 99,0:39:04.52,0:39:06.43,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No, I do. I know how this usually goes.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:08.13,0:39:12.03,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I loved all the manga my grandpa drew.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:12.03,0:39:15.35,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,But my parents didn't feel the same way.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:15.35,0:39:17.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,They hated him and what he created.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:17.96,0:39:19.12,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Can you guess why?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:19.89,0:39:20.79,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No, why?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:20.79,0:39:22.78,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Because his works couldn't sell.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:22.78,0:39:27.43,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}What you see there is his only\N manga that ever got serialized.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:28.02,0:39:29.61,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Only three volumes came out.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:30.37,0:39:32.68,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Despite that, he continued drawing.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:32.68,0:39:35.35,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Even when he had to borrow money from my father.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:36.29,0:39:38.06,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,When my grandpa died,
Dialogue: 99,0:39:38.06,0:39:40.41,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,neither of my parents cried.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:41.10,0:39:43.96,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,They actually looked relieved to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:43.96,0:39:46.86,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Made me realize they considered him a burden.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:46.86,0:39:49.83,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}So when I told them\N I wanted to be a manga artist too,
Dialogue: 99,0:39:49.83,0:39:51.37,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,they immediately sent me away.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:51.37,0:39:53.51,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Is that why you came to this town?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:53.51,0:39:55.24,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It was their idea of making me rethink it.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:55.24,0:39:57.23,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Not sure how that's supposed\N to change my mind, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:00.69,0:40:03.41,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,This is the first manga I ever drew.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:03.41,0:40:05.09,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I made it for my grandpa.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:05.09,0:40:07.03,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,He read it, and said it was interesting.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:08.04,0:40:10.87,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,He showed me how fun it is to draw your own story.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:11.76,0:40:14.49,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,But when my father found out, he threw it away.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:14.49,0:40:17.27,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Asked me if I wanted to live\N the same miserable life as my grandpa.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:17.27,0:40:18.75,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,He tore it to pieces.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:19.56,0:40:20.88,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And now I got it back.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:22.07,0:40:24.62,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Had you heard of Hanashiro Mitsuo before?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:24.62,0:40:26.60,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I hadn't. Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:26.60,0:40:27.91,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Of course you hadn't.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:28.72,0:40:33.02,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I went to so many bookstores\N in search of my grandpa's works
Dialogue: 99,0:40:33.02,0:40:34.75,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,and couldn't find a single volume.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:35.45,0:40:37.83,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,My grandpa's manga was nowhere to be seen.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:38.63,0:40:41.25,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,He was just a no-name artist no one knew about.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:42.57,0:40:44.13,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,So I had this thought.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:44.13,0:40:46.41,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,In order to leave a mark on this world,
Dialogue: 99,0:40:46.41,0:40:48.87,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,you need to be blessed with exceptional talent.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:50.22,0:40:53.14,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,So what you want from the tunnel is...
Dialogue: 99,0:40:55.79,0:40:58.49,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I want the talent to become an exceptional artist.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:59.10,0:41:02.77,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Only then will I be able to draw a manga\Nthat'll be remembered long after I'm gone.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:05.62,0:41:07.28,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,But Anzu, Urashima Tunnel—
Dialogue: 99,0:41:07.28,0:41:08.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:08.22,0:41:11.65,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna tell me it can't grant this wish?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:11.65,0:41:14.32,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Hypocrite. You want it to\N bring your sister back from the dead.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:16.22,0:41:17.41,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:25.43,0:41:27.41,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm curious about what you tried to submit.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:27.93,0:41:29.27,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Could you maybe let me read it?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:29.27,0:41:30.54,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What? Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:30.54,0:41:31.09,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:31.34,0:41:35.05,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm not satisfied with it.\NWith the plot, the characters, all of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:35.75,0:41:37.02,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That's why I couldn't send it.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:37.02,0:41:39.48,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But didn't you draw it\N so that someone would read it?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:39.48,0:41:41.38,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You think I'd let anyone read it
Dialogue: 99,0:41:41.38,0:41:43.02,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,when I'm not even happy with it myself?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:43.02,0:41:44.45,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,But if no one reads it,
Dialogue: 99,0:41:44.45,0:41:47.03,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,it'll just gather dust and get reduced to trash.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:47.03,0:41:49.02,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh shut up, you wanna get punched too?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:49.02,0:41:50.74,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's not like you care about manga, Touno.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:50.74,0:41:53.32,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Aren't we allies, though?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:01.02,0:42:02.95,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's really nothing special.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:02.95,0:42:05.33,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That's all you need to know.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:05.33,0:42:08.59,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Just let me be the judge of that.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:38.92,0:42:40.35,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's great.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:40.35,0:42:43.33,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,The setting is so complex, yet it's really easy to read.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:43.65,0:42:46.04,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And the foreshadowing is insanely good.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:46.04,0:42:47.34,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,The ending took me by surprise.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:48.53,0:42:50.96,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Actually, can I read it again?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:01.72,0:43:02.89,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:02.89,0:43:03.95,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You made me happy.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:04.49,0:43:05.19,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 99,0:43:06.27,0:43:10.19,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But there's tons of people\N who can write manga on that level.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:10.44,0:43:13.45,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I understand very well how rough\N it is to make a living out of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:13.80,0:43:16.01,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That's why I want to be exceptional.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:16.60,0:43:20.91,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I want the talent to leave my mark on this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:21.82,0:43:23.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You're incredible, Anzu.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:23.90,0:43:26.76,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I think you already have talent.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:26.76,0:43:29.09,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You're already exceptional, so why—
Dialogue: 99,0:43:29.09,0:43:31.31,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Not at all. You've got it wrong.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:31.31,0:43:33.06,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You're the exceptional one here.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:33.74,0:43:35.62,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I understood that during our aquarium trip.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:36.24,0:43:38.83,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,The world you live in is nothing like other people's.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:40.04,0:43:42.14,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You really drove it home for me
Dialogue: 99,0:43:42.14,0:43:45.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,that my problems are so tiny and mundane.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:45.96,0:43:46.98,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:47.35,0:43:50.07,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,In order to make your wish a reality,
Dialogue: 99,0:43:50.07,0:43:52.73,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,you're fully prepared to sacrifice everything else.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:54.11,0:43:58.35,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I think that might be why Urashima Tunnel found you.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:58.35,0:44:00.78,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You're overestimating me, I'm just an ordinary—
Dialogue: 99,0:44:12.92,0:44:15.79,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I want to see the world the same way you do.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:15.79,0:44:17.80,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That's what I need the tunnel for.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:19.89,0:44:21.76,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Touno.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:23.12,0:44:25.14,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What does this world look like to you?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:28.33,0:44:29.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's dull and lifeless.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:30.67,0:44:32.19,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That can be nice sometimes.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:36.51,0:44:39.73,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Next time you enter the tunnel,\N you won't turn back until you find Karen, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:40.32,0:44:41.05,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:42.25,0:44:43.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving until then.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:43.90,0:44:45.14,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:45.14,0:44:47.91,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm not turning back until I get the talent I want.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:49.36,0:44:50.37,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,When do we do it?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:51.01,0:44:51.92,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I picked a date already.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:52.49,0:44:53.78,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,August 2nd.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:01.30,0:45:02.19,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Kaoru!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:04.34,0:45:05.58,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,There's a festival next week.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:05.58,0:45:08.11,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm going with Sugisaki and his friends, wanna join us?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:09.25,0:45:10.05,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh, I...
Dialogue: 99,0:45:10.05,0:45:11.82,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Ah! You're going with Hanashiro, aren't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:11.82,0:45:13.79,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,My bad, how boorish of me to invite you.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:12.97,0:45:14.62,GJM_Overlap_1080p,,0,0,0,,I already told you we're not...
Dialogue: 99,0:45:17.56,0:45:19.18,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Actually, that's not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:39.10,0:45:40.45,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me I'm late.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:40.45,0:45:41.70,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:41.70,0:45:43.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You're actually early.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:43.40,0:45:45.44,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Why'd you come so early?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:45.44,0:45:47.56,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I heard it's good manners to be ten minutes early.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:50.61,0:45:51.95,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Playing the gentleman, I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:54.84,0:45:55.57,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:34.87,0:46:39.07,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The fireworks show will soon commence.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:39.49,0:46:46.32,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Cast your gaze to the south over the sea.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:46.72,0:46:48.95,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please enjoy the show.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:41.57,0:46:45.28,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You know, it said "No tresspassing" on the sign there.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:45.28,0:46:49.35,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Years ago, I found this spot with\N Karen when we came to the festival.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:57.07,0:46:58.83,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Why did you invite me?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:00.62,0:47:02.65,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Who knows how much time the tunnel will steal.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:03.83,0:47:05.74,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Maybe a thousand years will pass.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:07.42,0:47:08.54,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,If that happens,
Dialogue: 99,0:47:09.52,0:47:12.38,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,it'll be just me, you, and Karen.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:12.92,0:47:14.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I wonder if manga will still exist?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:14.99,0:47:19.38,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Pictures and stories have existed in this world\N for thousands of years, if not more.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:20.26,0:47:23.24,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And manga is pretty much that, a story with pictures.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:23.24,0:47:25.88,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Then we don't need to worry, I guess.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:53.70,0:47:57.33,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Can I ask why you picked August 2nd?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:59.26,0:48:00.97,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,The day I came here with Karen,
Dialogue: 99,0:48:01.53,0:48:03.03,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,our parents had a big fight.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:04.55,0:48:08.03,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The two of us came to the festival\N to sort of run away from home.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:10.25,0:48:12.04,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Karen acted really excited,
Dialogue: 99,0:48:16.23,0:48:17.46,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,but she was also crying.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:21.27,0:48:24.93,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,August 2nd is her death anniversary.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:24.23,0:49:26.19,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Gosh, you've got me there.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:26.19,0:49:28.56,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,This sushi must've been expensive.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:28.56,0:49:29.45,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It was!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:29.72,0:49:30.97,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 99,0:49:32.10,0:49:32.87,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Makes me happy, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:32.87,0:49:33.83,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's nothing, really.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:33.83,0:49:35.96,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Come on, we should eat.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:35.96,0:49:36.66,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Help yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:40.61,0:49:41.54,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Is someone there?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:45.70,0:49:48.27,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't know you were back.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:48.27,0:49:50.43,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Look, this is him.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:51.00,0:49:52.83,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,My son Kaoru.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:53.35,0:49:54.72,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh, your father mentioned you.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:54.72,0:49:56.35,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to finally meet you.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:57.35,0:50:00.06,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Did you forget how to speak?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:00.06,0:50:02.81,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Introduce yourself to your new mother.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:05.93,0:50:06.69,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:06.99,0:50:09.07,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I did want to mention it to you, believe me.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:09.07,0:50:11.60,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,But you know how life is, been busy with work.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:11.60,0:50:13.96,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,There never was a good time to bring it up.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:13.96,0:50:17.38,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I know it's a little sudden, but there you have it.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:17.38,0:50:19.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Join us. We're having a little party.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:19.90,0:50:20.89,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Let's raise a toast!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:20.89,0:50:23.08,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Didn't the doctor tell you to avoid alcohol?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:23.36,0:50:25.09,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's a special occasion.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:25.09,0:50:29.51,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kaoru! We'll be moving soon, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:29.51,0:50:32.57,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I decided it's better to leave Kouzaki\N and go live in Tokyo instead.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:32.57,0:50:34.33,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I already have some job prospects there.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:34.33,0:50:36.05,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I hope you get hired soon.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:36.05,0:50:38.77,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to living a completely new life.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:42.25,0:50:43.98,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kaoru?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:44.88,0:50:46.13,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:51.28,0:50:52.58,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 99,0:50:53.70,0:50:56.27,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,The hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:00.20,0:51:00.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Answer me.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:00.99,0:51:02.62,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Kaoru?!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:14.84,0:51:18.30,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Can you hear this gentle song?
Dialogue: 99,0:51:18.30,0:51:22.14,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's a croaking little frog.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:22.89,0:51:26.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Can you hear this gentle song?
Dialogue: 99,0:51:27.38,0:51:31.60,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's a croaking little frog.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:03.47,0:52:05.71,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I like the atmosphere of this place.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:05.71,0:52:07.38,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's very old.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:07.38,0:52:09.47,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'd often come here with my family as a child.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:13.26,0:52:15.91,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Is this table designed so you can play games?
Dialogue: 99,0:52:15.91,0:52:18.06,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a hundred yen per game.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:19.15,0:52:20.92,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll give it a try later.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:24.46,0:52:25.72,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What did you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 99,0:52:32.93,0:52:36.59,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You know the manga that you read?
Dialogue: 99,0:52:37.37,0:52:39.83,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I sent it to Yuutousha after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:39.83,0:52:40.68,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:40.68,0:52:43.29,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I figured I might as well try,\N since it's a completed work.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:44.60,0:52:48.12,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,But I wasn't really expecting anything to come out of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:48.12,0:52:48.91,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:51.14,0:52:54.67,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,This morning I got a call from an editor, though,
Dialogue: 99,0:52:55.65,0:52:58.32,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,and he apparently really liked it.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:59.60,0:53:02.41,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,He asked me if we could work together.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:04.66,0:53:06.23,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,So you can debut as an artist?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:06.23,0:53:09.07,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No, I just got an editor assigned to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:09.65,0:53:11.53,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,We haven't sorted out anything more yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:12.36,0:53:14.70,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I don't really know much about the process,
Dialogue: 99,0:53:14.70,0:53:18.02,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}but what I'm getting from this is that\N someone appreciates your talent.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:18.99,0:53:19.98,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That's not...
Dialogue: 99,0:53:21.75,0:53:23.95,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm as lucky as you think I am.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:24.80,0:53:27.27,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing they're just calling dibs on me for now,
Dialogue: 99,0:53:27.27,0:53:29.35,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,and are going to evaluate the situation after.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:30.93,0:53:32.13,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Anzu, you're—
Dialogue: 99,0:53:32.13,0:53:33.19,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Here's your order.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:34.15,0:53:35.86,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,A sandwich set,
Dialogue: 99,0:53:37.33,0:53:38.89,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,and a rice omelette.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:40.22,0:53:41.76,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Please enjoy.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:49.78,0:53:51.41,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That's all I had to say.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:52.65,0:53:54.05,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm just updating you.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:54.75,0:53:58.85,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And more importantly,\N we're entering the tunnel tomorrow, no?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:58.85,0:54:00.43,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Have you prepared everything?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:09.90,0:54:12.65,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I think we should postpone it.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:13.26,0:54:14.11,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:14.39,0:54:16.11,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,We should really think it through.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:16.11,0:54:17.36,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I did!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:17.36,0:54:19.19,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I thought it through, and I want to do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:19.19,0:54:22.07,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to convince me, or yourself?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:22.07,0:54:24.12,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I don't like this tone, Touno.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:24.51,0:54:27.37,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. This is an important decision.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:28.41,0:54:30.67,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I know you're still a little hesitant.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:30.67,0:54:31.37,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm—
Dialogue: 99,0:54:35.17,0:54:38.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm just not good enough.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:40.55,0:54:42.27,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I lack the confidence.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:44.62,0:54:47.72,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That's why I need the tunnel to make me special.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:53.65,0:54:54.67,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:55.71,0:54:58.79,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You're right that I'm not sure what to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:12.60,0:55:13.98,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,How about we eat first?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:14.75,0:55:17.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Can't think properly on an empty stomach.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:40.64,0:55:46.95,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an8}A deer has been struck by a train\N between Kawagata and Oosara stations.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:47.54,0:55:53.58,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an8}Regrettably, the next train is expected\N to be delayed by around thirty minutes.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:54.21,0:55:57.21,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We apologize for the inconvenience
Dialogue: 99,0:55:57.21,0:55:58.92,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and appreciate your patience.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:20.28,0:56:22.03,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you before.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:22.77,0:56:25.80,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It's quite common around here for trains\N to be delayed because of deer.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:26.49,0:56:27.47,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:33.46,0:56:34.57,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I have an umbrella.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:34.57,0:56:35.37,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Wanna borrow it?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:43.04,0:56:44.51,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,This is so silly.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:47.56,0:56:48.68,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What's your deal?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:48.68,0:56:50.12,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I noticed you don't have one.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:50.68,0:56:52.74,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Your clothes are gonna get wet.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:52.74,0:56:54.95,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,The hell? Are you playing a good Samaritan?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:55.50,0:56:58.19,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You lend me the umbrella, but then what about you?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:58.19,0:57:00.35,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I live close to the station, so I'm fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:00.35,0:57:01.86,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That doesn't answer my question.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:02.36,0:57:04.69,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Your parents probably won't want\N to see you drenched like this.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:04.98,0:57:06.44,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No, they abandoned me.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:06.75,0:57:08.21,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That must be nice.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:08.21,0:57:10.20,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I only have a shitty father.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:14.55,0:57:16.47,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Can I take you up on this offer?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:16.47,0:57:17.19,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:21.49,0:57:24.56,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Can I have your name and phone number?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:24.56,0:57:25.29,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:27.35,0:57:28.66,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Touno Kaoru.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:28.66,0:57:30.03,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Hanashiro Anzu.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:44.33,0:57:47.11,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,A smile suits you. I like it.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:47.76,0:57:48.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You too.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:51.94,0:57:52.45,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:52.96,0:57:54.94,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I actually need to give your umbrella back.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:54.94,0:57:56.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:56.99,0:57:58.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Just throw it out, honestly.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:58.40,0:57:59.50,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It was a cheap one.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:59.50,0:58:01.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I always return what I borrow.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:01.40,0:58:04.42,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It doesn't hurt to have one either, no?
Dialogue: 99,0:58:05.38,0:58:06.34,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:54.09,0:58:55.95,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Are you Kaoru's friend?
Dialogue: 99,0:58:55.95,0:58:57.04,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Sorry, he's not here.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:57.04,0:59:00.15,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,He left last night and hasn't come back yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:00.15,0:59:03.03,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Not sure where he's gone to,\N but he does this sometimes.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:03.03,0:59:04.77,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Nothing to panic about.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:07.79,0:59:08.75,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Honestly...
Dialogue: 99,0:59:25.43,0:59:26.13,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Touno...
Dialogue: 99,0:59:31.79,0:59:33.05,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Touno...
Dialogue: 99,0:59:37.72,0:59:39.06,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Touno!
Dialogue: 99,0:59:40.92,0:59:41.89,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Touno!
Dialogue: 99,0:59:42.89,0:59:44.04,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Touno!
Dialogue: 99,0:59:44.84,0:59:45.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Touno!
Dialogue: 99,0:59:49.89,0:59:50.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 99,1:00:12.36,1:00:14.01,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}By the time this message reaches you,
Dialogue: 99,1:00:14.95,1:00:17.76,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll already be deep inside Urashima Tunnel.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:18.37,1:00:20.61,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're probably mad at me.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:20.61,1:00:22.62,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or maybe you're just disappointed.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:22.62,1:00:25.06,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe even a bit of both.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:25.06,1:00:25.73,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 99,1:00:26.92,1:00:30.34,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You absolutely cannot enter the tunnel.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:31.36,1:00:34.63,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2\i1}You said you wanted to be\N blessed with exceptional talent,
Dialogue: 99,1:00:34.63,1:00:36.92,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I think it's something you already have.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:36.92,1:00:40.09,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I very much enjoyed reading your manga,
Dialogue: 99,1:00:40.09,1:00:42.97,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and the fact you got in contact with an editor
Dialogue: 99,1:00:43.48,1:00:45.37,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}already makes you special.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:46.41,1:00:49.08,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to read more of your manga, Anzu.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:49.08,1:00:51.75,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Both one-shots and serialized volumes.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:52.52,1:00:54.28,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want you to focus on drawing.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:56.42,1:00:59.94,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2\i1}I'll also share with you something \N I've come to realize about the tunnel.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:01.36,1:01:03.89,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The rumors say you can get whatever you want.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:04.87,1:01:06.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that's not the case.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:07.67,1:01:09.65,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Urashima Tunnel...
Dialogue: 99,1:01:28.92,1:01:30.04,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Urashima Tunnel
Dialogue: 99,1:01:31.25,1:01:33.73,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}returns to you what you've lost.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:35.12,1:01:38.76,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You won't obtain the talent you want from it.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:40.28,1:01:43.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please understand that I had to go in alone.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:45.22,1:01:48.37,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Anzu, you should focus on drawing.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:48.37,1:01:51.01,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leave the mark you wanted to leave.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:52.39,1:01:55.30,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I come back, be it a thousand years later,
Dialogue: 99,1:01:55.30,1:01:57.74,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to read whatever you've created.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:59.10,1:02:02.72,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I really enjoyed our little alliance over the past month.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:03.76,1:02:04.93,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I just wanted to say...
Dialogue: 99,1:02:30.04,1:02:31.76,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 99,1:02:34.66,1:02:35.77,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:35.77,1:02:36.65,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Coward!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:36.97,1:02:38.47,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You only think about yourself!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:38.47,1:02:41.15,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You have zero idea how I feel, I swear!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:41.44,1:02:42.91,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You act all cool and whatnot
Dialogue: 99,1:02:42.91,1:02:44.66,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,and then leave without a single word!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:44.66,1:02:47.36,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What happened to working together?!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:47.36,1:02:49.15,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You can't end the deal on your own!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:55.90,1:02:59.26,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea...
Dialogue: 99,1:03:01.79,1:03:03.25,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,any idea how I feel?
Dialogue: 99,1:03:10.27,1:03:13.76,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,If I could just be by your side,
Dialogue: 99,1:03:15.03,1:03:17.93,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I was ready to abandon this world.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:32.30,1:03:33.87,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Fourteen and a half hours.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:34.54,1:03:36.19,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Four years have passed outside.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:45.54,1:03:46.34,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Karen...
Dialogue: 99,1:03:54.21,1:03:55.44,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Karen...
Dialogue: 99,1:04:08.41,1:04:09.38,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 99,1:04:10.36,1:04:11.24,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Karen?
Dialogue: 99,1:04:13.40,1:04:14.75,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 99,1:04:51.98,1:04:53.29,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:04:53.79,1:04:55.27,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're awake.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:55.27,1:04:56.47,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Karen?
Dialogue: 99,1:04:56.47,1:04:58.04,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Yeah? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:01.20,1:05:03.20,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Is that banana juice?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:03.20,1:05:05.30,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Bingo! Wanna drink it together?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:06.46,1:05:08.19,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I had a really strange dream.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:10.89,1:05:12.03,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What happened ?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:13.82,1:05:14.92,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I already forgot.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:14.92,1:05:16.59,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:17.21,1:05:19.53,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I remember mine, actually!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:19.53,1:05:24.00,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I had this dream the other day where\N I caught a hundred Hercules beetles with you!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:24.00,1:05:25.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Really? Wow!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:28.71,1:05:30.32,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh, actually!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:30.32,1:05:31.47,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Wait here!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:39.80,1:05:41.08,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:41.37,1:05:42.71,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Rhinoceros beetle!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:42.71,1:05:44.80,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I remembered I caught it for you.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:44.80,1:05:46.27,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's huge.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:46.27,1:05:47.41,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:47.41,1:05:48.47,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Where did you find it?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:48.85,1:05:49.85,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Not telling you!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:49.85,1:05:51.79,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh come on, don't be like that.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:51.79,1:05:54.61,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,If I tell you, you're gonna go catch one yourself.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:54.61,1:05:55.42,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Was it that obvious?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:55.42,1:05:57.43,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Absolutely!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:57.43,1:05:59.63,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I'm gonna make dinner today!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:59.63,1:06:00.46,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,By yourself?
Dialogue: 99,1:06:00.46,1:06:02.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Yes. All by myself.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:02.40,1:06:04.06,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,What are you making, then?
Dialogue: 99,1:06:04.06,1:06:05.66,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Let me think...
Dialogue: 99,1:06:05.66,1:06:07.48,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Cup noodles and...
Dialogue: 99,1:06:07.83,1:06:10.57,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And I'll microwave some rice balls.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:10.57,1:06:13.10,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That doesn't really count as making it yourself.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:13.10,1:06:14.74,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It absolutely does!
Dialogue: 99,1:06:15.91,1:06:18.81,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm the one pouring hot water into the cup,
Dialogue: 99,1:06:18.81,1:06:21.88,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,and I'm the one putting the rice balls in the microwave.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:21.88,1:06:24.09,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Plus, I'm the one setting the table too.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:24.09,1:06:26.00,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,See? Totally making it myself.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:27.33,1:06:29.63,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Watch it! You spilled it all!
Dialogue: 99,1:06:29.63,1:06:31.01,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'll get a cloth.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:33.01,1:06:35.55,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Where the hell am I?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:02.12,1:07:03.37,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I didn't lose these.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:03.70,1:07:04.96,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I got rid of them.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:14.48,1:07:15.34,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:15.98,1:07:17.63,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I thought you couldn't get new ones.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:39.43,1:07:40.23,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Anzu...
Dialogue: 99,1:07:40.23,1:07:42.00,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,A friend's messaging you?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:44.96,1:07:47.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No, she's not a friend anymore.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:47.99,1:07:50.33,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Huh? Did you have a fight?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:51.20,1:07:52.87,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,No, that's not the reason.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:53.49,1:07:55.87,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't fight with your friends.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:55.87,1:07:58.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You don't have many of them.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:58.40,1:08:01.17,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's fine. I have you, Karen.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:01.17,1:08:01.81,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd say that.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:02.16,1:08:04.74,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You love me a lot, don't you?
Dialogue: 99,1:08:05.44,1:08:08.70,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That's why I can always smile when I'm with you.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:08.70,1:08:11.19,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Since, you know, I love you too.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:12.11,1:08:13.44,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Same goes for me.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:13.71,1:08:17.20,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But I don't want that to stop you\N from finding a girl you love.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:26.75,1:08:27.65,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,1:08:27.65,1:08:28.96,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And when you do,
Dialogue: 99,1:08:28.96,1:08:32.74,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}if the person you fall in love with\N ends up falling in love with you too,
Dialogue: 99,1:08:32.74,1:08:35.09,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,the three of us will be smiling together!
Dialogue: 99,1:08:52.73,1:08:53.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,1:08:56.89,1:08:58.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I want to stay with you, Karen.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:01.48,1:09:02.41,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,But right now...
Dialogue: 99,1:09:05.32,1:09:06.66,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,There's someone I need to see!
Dialogue: 99,1:09:06.66,1:09:07.90,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:19.54,1:09:20.89,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I love you, Kaoru!
Dialogue: 99,1:09:22.78,1:09:23.86,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day!
Dialogue: 99,1:09:35.24,1:09:36.69,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:46.51,1:09:49.95,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I need to leave to catch the last train.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:50.90,1:09:51.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Of course, take care.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:51.99,1:09:53.88,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'll be here tomorrow at 10.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:53.88,1:09:55.36,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,That's fine, thanks.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:55.36,1:09:57.40,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow, then.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:22.28,1:10:24.95,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You're not letting me return your umbrella, are you?
Dialogue: 99,1:10:32.67,1:10:33.33,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Anzu!
Dialogue: 99,1:10:52.60,1:10:53.65,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Anzu...
Dialogue: 99,1:10:56.76,1:10:57.61,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Anzu...
Dialogue: 99,1:11:00.15,1:11:01.24,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Anzu...
Dialogue: 99,1:11:05.31,1:11:06.16,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Anzu!
Dialogue: 99,1:11:12.74,1:11:13.33,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,1:11:24.01,1:11:27.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I need to tell you something!
Dialogue: 99,1:11:49.73,1:11:52.83,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Maybe you need a break.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:53.09,1:11:55.60,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You've been pushing out volumes ever since you started.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:56.63,1:11:58.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll find inspiration again.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:59.99,1:12:02.59,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really sorry.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:06.81,1:12:09.35,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You always carry this umbrella with you.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:09.61,1:12:11.35,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Is it some sort of charm?
Dialogue: 99,1:12:13.42,1:12:14.36,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 99,1:12:19.51,1:12:23.77,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2}In any case, I'll figure something out\N for your ongoing series.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:23.77,1:12:25.20,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:25.72,1:12:28.04,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Make sure you get some rest.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:30.54,1:12:31.32,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:43.62,1:12:49.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an8}A deer has been struck by a train\N between Oosara and Sugimori stations.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:50.41,1:12:56.31,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an8}Regrettably, the next train is expected\N to be delayed by around thirty minutes.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:56.82,1:12:59.34,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We apologize for the inconvenience
Dialogue: 99,1:12:59.34,1:13:00.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and appreciate your patience.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:26.91,1:13:28.01,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,1:13:29.66,1:13:32.26,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I've always...
Dialogue: 99,1:13:33.99,1:13:35.02,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,always...
Dialogue: 99,1:15:23.30,1:15:24.19,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Touno...
Dialogue: 99,1:15:25.52,1:15:26.44,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Touno...
Dialogue: 99,1:15:28.01,1:15:28.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Touno!
Dialogue: 99,1:15:34.37,1:15:37.01,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,An... zu?
Dialogue: 99,1:15:37.01,1:15:37.75,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:38.62,1:15:40.10,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's been eight years.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:41.16,1:15:43.54,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 99,1:15:43.54,1:15:45.69,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You were taking so long I went to look for you.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:47.05,1:15:48.36,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Even though I said goodbye?
Dialogue: 99,1:15:49.19,1:15:51.86,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,We're in this together, remember?
Dialogue: 99,1:15:58.47,1:16:00.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I was writing you a message
Dialogue: 99,1:16:01.08,1:16:02.21,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,and then tripped.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:02.21,1:16:03.46,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I received it.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:03.46,1:16:04.12,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:16:10.50,1:16:11.67,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It reached me.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:13.57,1:16:15.79,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I took so long.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:31.81,1:16:35.27,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,{\q2\i1}The kiss lasted ten seconds,\N which makes it six and a half hours.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:53.66,1:16:55.05,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Thirteen years...
Dialogue: 99,1:16:55.05,1:16:57.89,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,And about 102 days, I guess.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:59.27,1:17:01.38,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,A lot must've changed.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:01.38,1:17:02.47,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:03.46,1:17:05.20,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's not like it's been a thousand years.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:07.03,1:17:07.99,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:09.94,1:17:12.39,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll get to read your manga series, too.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:12.39,1:17:13.60,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,How do you know about it?
Dialogue: 99,1:17:14.18,1:17:15.96,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I got your messages.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:15.96,1:17:17.78,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Even though it wasn't supposed to be possible.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:18.42,1:17:19.93,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,But I got them.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:22.94,1:17:24.75,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Maybe you didn't actually get them.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:25.38,1:17:26.50,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,The tunnel returned them to you.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:40.66,1:17:41.56,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,It's raining.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:42.58,1:17:44.01,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,My umbrella!
Dialogue: 99,1:17:54.80,1:17:56.32,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,You've kept it all these years?
Dialogue: 99,1:17:56.32,1:17:57.98,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I can finally return it.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:57.98,1:18:00.22,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,I no longer owe you anything.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:01.53,1:18:03.35,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Took you thirteen years, though.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:04.43,1:18:05.08,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 99,1:18:07.19,1:18:08.80,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,We have an entire future ahead of us.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:11.04,1:18:13.28,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,An entire future, huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:18:17.26,1:18:17.67,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,1000,0,,Anzu.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:17.26,1:18:17.67,GJM_Main_1080p,,1000,0,0,,Touno.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:25.66,1:18:26.47,GJM_Main_1080p,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
